        Service requirements
      </h3>
      <p
        class="googlesitekit-typography googlesitekit-typography--body googlesitekit-typography--medium"
      >
        <strong>
          A service account
        </strong>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section
      class="googlesitekit-feature-details-panel__section"
    >
      <h3
        class="googlesitekit-typography googlesitekit-typography--label googlesitekit-typography--large"
      >
        Setup checklist
      </h3>
      <ol
        class="googlesitekit-feature-details-panel__setup-list"
      >
        <li
          class="googlesitekit-typography googlesitekit-typography--body googlesitekit-typography--medium"
        >
          Connect your account
        </li>
        <li
          class="googlesitekit-typography googlesitekit-typography--body googlesitekit-typography--medium"
        >
          <span>
            Finish setup
          </span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
    <p
      class="googlesitekit-typography googlesitekit-typography--body googlesitekit-typography--medium"
    >
      You can always get help in our 
      <a
        aria-label="documentation (opens in a new tab)"
        class="googlesitekit-cta-link"
        href="https://example.com/docs/"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank"
      >
        <span
          class="googlesitekit-cta-link__contents"
        >
          documentation
        </span>
      </a>
       or 
      <a
        aria-label="support forum (opens in a new tab)"
        class="googlesitekit-cta-link"
        href="https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/google-site-kit/"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank"
      >
        <span
          class="googlesitekit-cta-link__contents"
        >
          support forum
        </span>
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
`;
